      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you should have separate counts for each table size and use a\nvariable in the function below to hold it e.g\n\nint table_size;\n\nif (thermal_solution \u003d\u003d FW_THERMAL_6W) {\n\tfan_step_table \u003d fan_step_table_6w;\n\ttable_size \u003d ARRAY_SIZE(fan_step_table_6w);\n} else {\n\tfan_step_table \u003d fan_step_table_15w;\n\ttable_size \u003d ARRAY_SIZE(fan_step_table_15w);\n}\n\nThen use table_size instead of NUM_FAN_LEVELS.\nOtherwise there is an unchecked requirement that the 2 tables must be the same\nsize, which may not be the case.",
      "revId": "943b8d43bf464f57a52b8e4233694407c9fbfd63",
